<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 111,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 111,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota marketings were 111,000 head, USDA said. The Friday estimate was 105,000 head. Saturday's actual marketings were 13,000, compared with the estimate of 15,000. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady with the midsession Friday.</p>
<p>				     Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 52.00 -53.00	   53.00 -54.00</p>
<p>few			   51.50  53.50	   52.50  54.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to $1.00 per cwt higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.    43.00 -47.00	   44.00 -47.00</p>
